## Command

```shell
biome format --write --use-editorconfig=true '{a,b}}.json'
```

## `.editorconfig`

```editorconfig

root = true

[*]
indent_style = space
indent_size = 4

[{a,b}}.json]
indent_size = 2

```

## `{a,b}}.json`

```json
{
  "test": 1
}

```

